  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Spreadsheet control is a feature-rich Excel-like spreadsheet component for building browser-based spreadsheet experiences. It supports formulas (400+ built-in functions), cell formatting, conditional formatting, data validation, sorting, filtering, charts, images, freeze panes, merge cells, named ranges, multiple sheets, undo/redo, import/export of Excel (XLSX) files, and wrap text. It is ideal for financial modeling, data entry applications, budget planners, and analytics tools built on ASP.NET Core.",
